  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>Defensive Followers specialize in protecting themselves from damage and, similarly, holding a defensive position. These <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a> make excellent support fighters, laying down suppression fire or helping to hold a corridor against an invading force. </p><ul>\n <li><b>Ability Scores:</b> A Defensive Follower gains a +2 bonus to either their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> (your choice).</li> \n <li><b>Defenses:</b> A Defensive Follower gains a +2 bonus to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>.</li> \n <li><b>Feats:</b> Defensive Followers gain the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Armor_Proficiency_(Light)\" title=\"Armor Proficiency (Light)\">Armor Proficiency (Light)</a> feat.</li> \n <li><b>Trained Skills:</b> Defensive Followers are <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Endurance\" title=\"Endurance\">Endurance</a>.</li> \n <li><b>Base Attack Bonus:</b> A Defensive Follower uses the below <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> progression:</li>\n</ul><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DEFENSIVE FOLLOWER LEVEL </th> \n   <th><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/BASE_ATTACK_BONUS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"BASE ATTACK BONUS\">BASE ATTACK BONUS</a> </th> \n   <th rowspan=\"11\"> </th> \n   <th>DEFENSIVE FOLLOWER LEVEL </th> \n   <th><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/BASE_ATTACK_BONUS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"BASE ATTACK BONUS\">BASE ATTACK BONUS</a> </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>1st </td> \n   <td>+0 </td> \n   <td>11th </td> \n   <td>+8 </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>2nd </td> \n   <td>+1 </td> \n   <td>12th </td> \n   <td>+9 </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>3rd </td> \n   <td>+2 </td> \n   <td>13th </td> \n   <td>+9 </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>4th </td> \n   <td>+3 </td> \n   <td>14th </td> \n   <td>+10 </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>5th </td> \n   <td>+3 </td> \n   <td>15th </td> \n   <td>+11 </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>6th </td> \n   <td>+4 </td> \n   <td>16th </td> \n   <td>+12 </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>7th </td> \n   <td>+5 </td> \n   <td>17th </td> \n   <td>+12 </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>8th </td> \n   <td>+6 </td> \n   <td>18th </td> \n   <td>+13 </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>9th </td> \n   <td>+6 </td> \n   <td>19th </td> \n   <td>+14 </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td>10th </td> \n   <td>+7 </td> \n   <td>20th </td> \n   <td>+15 </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
